#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:57 c638dd565c424a3c9e7bc5f95e4496cf
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked Rxn and Tn in the above pinouts. The Rxn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The Txn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn."
msgstr "上述引脚定义中，UART 标注为 Rxn 和 Tn。Rxn 引脚为 UARTn 的接收引脚，Txn 引脚为 UARTn 的发送引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:60 554f4bd0ca174085ac82ff03a1992e38
