msgstr "SERIAL6 -> UART6（MAVLink2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:68 ac3df2d6f9cd4fe4acf7e56034bec0ef
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:70 1adc6000064741a197728e8eb4bc1fbe
msgid ""
"RC input is configured for GHST by default on the TX1 (UART1_TX) pin using "
"half-duplex. To support other RC protocols set SERIAL1_OPTIONS to 0. This "
"will support all serial RC protocols except SBUS."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入默认在 TX1（UART1_TX）引脚上以半双工方式配置为 GHST。若要支持其他 RC 协议，请将 SERIAL1_OPTIONS 设为 "
"0，这将支持除 SBUS 外的所有串行 RC 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:72 74738b259e274cd282bef95c1798357b
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to the TX of the UART and ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` be "
"set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需连接至 UART 的 TX 引脚，并将 ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` 设为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:74 52b398faf30043a6b0fc7ea97598f28c
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX connection, and automatically provides telemetry. "
"Set ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF 还需 TX 连接，并自动提供数传。请将 ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` 设为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:76 9d254d4c1a234a8a941b707de068fbc4
msgid "For PPM and SBUS support on UART1_RX set BRD_ALT_CONFIG to 1."
msgstr "若要在 UART1_RX 上支持 PPM 和 SBUS，请将 BRD_ALT_CONFIG 设为 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:79 ffe26539b614452484ea10277ea2059a
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:81 78010d82fcba46e38b46ba0ded9a263e
msgid ""
"The Orqa FC 3030 F405 supports analog OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver) "
"using the CAM and VTX connectors. DisplayPort HD OSD can be enabled "
"simultaneously by setting :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 5 and using USART6 for"
" telemtry to the HD air unit by setting "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` = 42."
msgstr ""
"Orqa FC 3030 F405 通过 CAM 和 VTX 接头支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的模拟 "
"OSD。DisplayPort 高清 OSD 可通过设置 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 5 同时启用，并将 USART6 "
"用于高清 Air Unit 数传（设置 :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` = 42）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:84 c74ea1c39f5344feae2c6b06dafddf4c
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:86 be98d7b49f4d4b3c88d11d422d2dbcdc
msgid ""
"The Orqa FC 3030 F405 supports up to 8 PWM outputs(Mini supports 9). Outputs"
" 1-8 also support DShot. Outputs 1-4 support bi-directional DShot. Outputs "
"are grouped and each group must use the same output protocol:"
msgstr ""
"Orqa FC 3030 F405 最多支持 8 路 PWM 输出（Mini 支持 9 路）。输出 1-8 另外支持 DShot，输出 1-4 支持双向"
" DShot。输出按组划分，每组必须使用相同的输出协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:88 811cbea054bd49fea5b034467bf1bcc4
msgid "1,4-6 are group1"
msgstr "1、4-6 属于第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:89 d61851fb9abd49be99a1698e230d28c9
msgid "2 3 are group 2"
msgstr "2、3 属于第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:90 6c56f725daa14f2a833fa2ab4cefa81e
msgid "7,8 are group 3"
msgstr "7、8 属于第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:92 83adf7c07c7b402a9d4a0c6c4ec71000
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从 BetaflightX 四轴飞行器迁移的用户，前四路输出 M1-M4 已使用以下默认参数配置为与现有电机接线兼容："

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:94 87b2822987684dd6902516a4816cc882
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四轴）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:95 ea1ed9c5feef49cab0a995ec1f6bbee9
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:98 077a0d6e66374e3a8256251268c63fcf
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:100 332f1b907a674d6fbec23a669483da2e
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor via the VBAT pin, but no internal "
"current sensor. An external current sensor can be connected to the Curr pin."
" Default parameters for both internal voltage and external current "
"monitoring are set by default to :"
msgstr ""
"该飞控板通过 VBAT 引脚内置电压传感器，但无内部电流传感器。外部电流传感器可连接至 Curr 引脚。内部电压和外部电流监测的默认参数已预设为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:102 86a5e3c2bd37469bacbc1480e7ea7e4b
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:103 57ae5751e2ab46309812f18f9c7ed71a
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:104 663dd9760c414998960dd0a6cb7ad2cd
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 12"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:105 7a3a7630b6a24ae8a3d104e58431dd43
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 8.3"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 8.3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:106 5c1a25d07286454494134c47bb945e73
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 92.6"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 92.6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:109 a2307f4ca21c48b2b0b56af75cdafc0c
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:111 bf8a1c4ee3b14ed0b7f7fcc6fc1afdb8
msgid ""
"The Orqa FC 3030 F405 does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach "
"an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL connector."
msgstr "Orqa FC 3030 F405 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 接头使用 I2C 连接外置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:114 4e60845ac50e43b9883ca52e745516fc
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:116 416897b003154b0eaf634738590779dc
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"OrcaF405Pro\"."
msgstr ""
"该飞控板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的「OrcaF405Pro」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:119 b91245302258404fa263d3f5a3f7df00
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:121 89892da62cd1472c97d009d359c5e63d
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favorite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"初始固件可通过 DFU 方式加载：按住引导程序按钮的同时插入 USB。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 工具加载 「with_bl.hex」 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:123 47a5b6c0833f4ddf91e83201b94910e0
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"\"\\*.apj\" firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新时应使用 「\\*.apj」 固件文件。"
